{"id": "ta-en-001", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "இன்று வானிலை நன்றாக இருக்கிறது.", "reference": "The weather is nice today.", "metadata": {"register": "formal", "difficulty": "easy"}}
{"id": "ta-en-002", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "எனக்கு தமிழ் தெரியும்.", "reference": "I know Tamil.", "metadata": {"register": "neutral", "difficulty": "easy"}}
{"id": "ta-en-003", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "அவர் நேற்று சென்னைக்கு போனார்.", "reference": "He went to Chennai yesterday.", "metadata": {"register": "honorific", "difficulty": "easy"}}
{"id": "ta-en-004", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "நாங்கள் நாளை திரைப்படம் பார்க்கப் போகிறோம்.", "reference": "We are going to watch a movie tomorrow.", "metadata": {"register": "formal", "difficulty": "medium"}}
{"id": "ta-en-005", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "உனக்கு என்ன வேணும்?", "reference": "What do you want?", "metadata": {"register": "colloquial", "difficulty": "easy"}}
{"id": "ta-en-006", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "அவங்க ரொம்ப நல்லவங்க.", "reference": "They are very nice people.", "metadata": {"register": "colloquial", "difficulty": "medium"}}
{"id": "ta-en-007", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "எனக்கு உடம்பு சரியில்லை.", "reference": "I am not feeling well.", "metadata": {"register": "idiomatic", "difficulty": "medium", "note": "literal 'body not right' = feeling unwell"}}
{"id": "ta-en-008", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "இந்த புத்தகம் மிகவும் சுவாரஸ்யமாக இருந்தது.", "reference": "This book was very interesting.", "metadata": {"register": "formal", "difficulty": "medium"}}
{"id": "ta-en-009", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "கடையை மூடிட்டாங்க.", "reference": "They closed the shop.", "metadata": {"register": "colloquial", "difficulty": "medium"}}
{"id": "ta-en-010", "task": "translation_ta_en", "scoring": "judge", "input": "மழை பெய்யுது, குடையை எடுத்துக்கோ.", "reference": "It is raining, take an umbrella.", "metadata": {"register": "colloquial", "difficulty": "medium"}}
